00:51:55.080 --> 00:52:02.160 align:start position:19%
be 100% funded by Microsoft.
All planning, design, and construction

00:52:00.680 --> 00:52:06.680 align:start position:19%
of the infrastructure will also be
performed in collaboration with Cheyenne

00:52:04.640 --> 00:52:11.080 align:start position:19%
Board of Public Utilities and our local
development partners such as Leads and

00:52:09.360 --> 00:52:14.840 align:start position:19%
AVI.
The infrastructure will be developed in

00:52:12.600 --> 00:52:17.640 align:start position:19%
phases to support our phase full site
development.

00:52:16.240 --> 00:52:20.160 align:start position:19%
And with that, I'm available for
questions.

00:52:20.200 --> 00:52:22.680 align:start position:19%
&gt;&gt; Thank you.

